WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.850
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:37.120 --> 00:38.663
[Episode 1]

3
01:35.220 --> 01:37.623
Hey, everyone! The teacher's coming!

4
01:45.485 --> 01:47.223
Attendance!

5
01:47.223 --> 01:48.534
Kim Gi Ju.

6
01:49.317 --> 01:50.344
Kim Gi Ju?

7
01:50.344 --> 01:51.570
Yes, sir.

8
01:51.570 --> 01:52.960
Answer me on cue, okay?

9
01:52.960 --> 01:54.897
- Kim Ba Wool! - Here!

10
01:54.897 --> 01:56.568
- Kim Seong Jin. - Here.

11
01:56.568 --> 01:58.702
- Kim So Hee. - Here.

12
01:58.702 --> 02:00.638
- Kim Ha Yeon A. - Here!

13
02:00.638 --> 02:03.522
- Kim Ha Yeon B. - Here.

14
02:03.522 --> 02:05.502
- Noh Jin Yeong. - Here!

15
02:05.502 --> 02:07.068
- Park Jae Min. - Here.

16
02:07.068 --> 02:08.590
- Park Hyeon Ah. - Here.

17
02:08.590 --> 02:09.838
- Park Hye Yeong. - Here.

18
02:09.838 --> 02:11.009
Seo Gyeong Jin.

19
02:11.009 --> 02:12.398
- Yang Yeong Min. - Yup.

20
02:12.398 --> 02:14.073
- Lee Se Jun. - Here.

21
02:14.073 --> 02:15.716
- Lee Ye Jae. - Here.

22
02:15.716 --> 02:17.754
- Lee Yun Ah. - Here.

23
02:17.754 --> 02:19.473
- Im Jae Gyeong. - Here.

24
02:19.473 --> 02:20.803
Jang Ho Jae.

25
02:40.065 --> 02:42.726
Did you see it, Ha Yeon?

26
02:42.726 --> 02:44.956
- I saw this thing on YouTube yesterday-- - Yun Ah!

27
02:44.956 --> 02:46.280
Let's go to the restroom together.

28
02:46.280 --> 02:47.695
Okay!

29
02:56.476 --> 02:57.896
Kim Ha Yeon!

30
02:58.839 --> 03:00.166
No, not you.

31
03:00.166 --> 03:01.697
Me?

32
03:01.697 --> 03:03.074
You're B?

33
03:03.074 --> 03:05.600
What? No, I'm A.

34
03:05.600 --> 03:07.286
The teacher wants you, B.

35
03:08.111 --> 03:10.089
What are you doing, slacking off?

36
03:10.950 --> 03:12.150
Dancing.

37
03:12.150 --> 03:14.027
But you suck at dancing.

38
03:18.568 --> 03:20.660
Kim Ha Yeon B.

39
03:20.660 --> 03:22.748
What's your goal here?

40
03:25.163 --> 03:28.672
A mid-tier 4-year university in Seoul.

41
03:31.908 --> 03:33.275
And your ideal major?

42
03:35.298 --> 03:37.885
Whichever will have me, I guess.

43
03:39.682 --> 03:42.043
No specific dreams?

44
03:42.043 --> 03:43.937
Like, what do you want to be when you grow up?

45
03:44.738 --> 03:46.685
University...

46
03:46.685 --> 03:51.022
student... seems like a good place to start.

47
03:51.022 --> 03:52.290
That so?

48
03:52.290 --> 03:55.569
Well, then, let's see.

49
03:55.569 --> 03:57.237
We will...

50
04:02.117 --> 04:05.245
have to set our goal right around here.

51
04:08.890 --> 04:10.476
Okay. You can go.

52
04:21.909 --> 04:23.569
Alright, Teach...

53
04:34.563 --> 04:37.956
Yun Jae asked me if I wanted to go on a trip with him yesterday.

54
04:37.956 --> 04:39.416
Do you think it'll be alright?

55
04:40.642 --> 04:41.725
For real?

56
04:41.725 --> 04:43.214
- Through the night? - Yeah!

57
04:43.214 --> 04:44.230
The whole day.

58
04:44.230 --> 04:46.797
No way, what will you tell your parents?

59
04:46.797 --> 04:49.770
I'll just tell them I'm staying up studying at a study cafe.

60
04:51.554 --> 04:52.771
What are you looking at?

61
04:54.878 --> 04:57.839
I saw the way you looked at me just now.

62
04:57.839 --> 05:00.330
This is pissing me off.

63
05:00.330 --> 05:01.495
Kim Ha Yeon.

64
05:01.495 --> 05:03.639
Get your head out of the gutter!

65
05:04.338 --> 05:06.223
- What? Me? No, I... - Hey.

66
05:06.223 --> 05:08.518
You're the one with dirty thoughts, Heo Mi Hee.

67
05:08.518 --> 05:10.632
No, I'm not!

68
05:10.632 --> 05:13.345
Hey, hear this. Yesterday, Yun Jae and I...

69
05:15.167 --> 05:17.283
What do I do?

70
05:17.283 --> 05:21.380
- Well, I guess that calls for a condom. - Hey!

71
05:21.380 --> 05:23.088
Come with me, you!

72
05:23.088 --> 05:25.894
What? You can say it here, come on!

73
06:05.532 --> 06:09.112
Hey, Kim Ha Yeon was being such a cow today, don't you think?

74
06:10.161 --> 06:11.787
Wrong chat.

75
06:30.025 --> 06:33.845
[Reserved for firetrucks only]

76
06:49.258 --> 06:53.176
[Award]

77
06:55.728 --> 06:57.791
I'm home.

78
07:02.589 --> 07:06.461
Mom, I need money for my math workbook. Just leave me 20,000 won.

79
07:06.461 --> 07:08.375
Use your textbook.

80
07:16.881 --> 07:19.155
There's no secret about my birth.

81
07:21.360 --> 07:23.452
Nor any special talents.

82
07:25.384 --> 07:26.853
No best friend.

83
07:26.853 --> 07:28.707
No boyfriend.

84
07:35.898 --> 07:37.067
Ha Yeon...

85
07:37.067 --> 07:39.031
Did you see that message?

86
07:39.031 --> 07:43.269
It's just that Yun Ah kept saying bad things about you.

87
07:43.269 --> 07:45.127
It's fine, no big deal.

88
07:46.352 --> 07:47.714
I'm not kindhearted,

89
07:47.714 --> 07:50.717
but I can't bring myself to stand up for myself, either.

90
07:51.359 --> 07:56.825
Then, Ha Yeon, can I borrow the white sundress you bought last time?

91
07:56.825 --> 07:59.747
I was thinking of wearing it to see Yun Jae.

92
07:59.747 --> 08:00.793
Please?

93
08:09.331 --> 08:10.432
Sure.

94
08:17.591 --> 08:20.500
That little wench.

95
08:24.233 --> 08:28.384
I'm just a frayed curtain on a windowsill.

96
08:28.384 --> 08:31.412
A seldom-used dustpan and an old clock.

97
08:32.789 --> 08:36.064
An unused kettle at the back of the classroom, or an abandoned cup,

98
08:36.064 --> 08:37.985
that's who I was...

99
09:59.098 --> 10:01.231
until I met you.

100
10:01.921 --> 10:05.772
[1. Kim Ha Yeon B]

101
10:05.772 --> 10:07.978
[Summer Vacation]

102
10:07.978 --> 10:09.019
Listen up.

103
10:09.019 --> 10:10.844
Don't waste all your time frolicking around.

104
10:10.844 --> 10:12.295
- Yes, sir! - Yes, Teach!

105
10:12.295 --> 10:14.572
Less than half of senior year is left.

106
10:14.572 --> 10:16.192
- Yeah! - Yes, sir!

107
10:16.192 --> 10:20.427
I said, more than half of your senior year has passed!

108
10:20.427 --> 10:22.953
Go, now, go. You can leave.

109
10:22.953 --> 10:24.918
- Thank you, Teach! - Thank you!

110
10:37.478 --> 10:40.842
The start of summer vacation means the start of summer school.

111
10:40.842 --> 10:42.424
See you tomorrow. Roger, out.

112
10:42.424 --> 10:44.825
- No, no! - Why is this happening?

113
10:44.825 --> 10:46.271
- Say no to summer school! - Boo!

114
10:46.271 --> 10:48.507
This sucks major butt!

115
10:56.811 --> 10:59.535
Anyone want to go watch a movie after class tomorrow?

116
11:00.553 --> 11:02.217
Oh, me, me!

117
11:02.217 --> 11:03.847
Me too, me too!

118
11:03.847 --> 11:05.595
What are we watching?

119
11:07.247 --> 11:08.896
Something raunchy.

120
11:08.896 --> 11:10.233
Something hot!

121
11:13.020 --> 11:14.484
Sounds fun.

122
11:14.484 --> 11:16.411
We'll watch it all together!

123
11:20.508 --> 11:22.611
I'm home.

124
11:23.933 --> 11:24.976
What are you doing, Mom?

125
11:24.976 --> 11:26.928
Kim Ha Yeon. Go start packing now.

126
11:26.928 --> 11:28.633
We'll get stuck in traffic unless we leave right now.

127
11:28.633 --> 11:29.947
Where are we going?

128
11:29.947 --> 11:31.424
Jung Yeon!

129
11:35.883 --> 11:38.852
But Mom, can't I leave a week later?

130
11:38.852 --> 11:40.078
Why?

131
11:40.078 --> 11:41.489
Is it because of school?

132
11:41.489 --> 11:43.170
What, a group project or something?

133
11:43.170 --> 11:44.645
No, not that.

134
11:44.645 --> 11:47.503
I have a sign language lesson on Saturday.

135
11:47.503 --> 11:49.744
- Mom. - How about this? We go now,

136
11:49.744 --> 11:51.819
and you can come back home in time for your lesson.

137
11:51.819 --> 11:53.959
But for now, let's all leave together, okay?

138
11:53.959 --> 11:55.855
Come on, Mom's begging you.

139
11:55.855 --> 11:57.947
Please, Jung Yeon, please!

140
11:57.947 --> 11:59.397
Mom.

141
12:00.138 --> 12:02.941
- Darling! - What the actual hell.

142
12:02.941 --> 12:06.303
Are these all the golf clubs? Do we have everything?

143
12:06.303 --> 12:08.339
- Mom. - I can't believe this.

144
12:08.339 --> 12:11.601
Where did the duffel bag go?

145
12:13.222 --> 12:14.780
Mom!

146
12:14.780 --> 12:16.144
What!

147
12:23.931 --> 12:28.757
Your dad's going to be the caddie for pro golfer Cho Ji Hyeon this summer.

148
12:31.005 --> 12:33.511
We'll be spending the whole summer at the Upo Country Club.

149
12:33.511 --> 12:34.932
No whining.

150
12:38.167 --> 12:40.147
What about my summer school?

151
12:40.147 --> 12:43.270
I-I need to attend those classes, you know.

152
12:43.270 --> 12:46.664
Are you sure you'll get accepted to a university?

153
12:46.664 --> 12:47.701
What?

154
12:48.372 --> 12:51.769
I don't expect you to make it into a SKY university, like your brother,

155
12:51.769 --> 12:53.883
but would any 4-year university in Seoul...

156
12:54.542 --> 12:56.251
accept you? At all?

157
12:56.251 --> 12:57.464
Mom.

158
12:57.464 --> 13:00.286
I'm doing my best, too, you know.

159
13:00.286 --> 13:02.655
Seriously.

160
13:02.655 --> 13:07.525
Working as a teacher all these years, I've seen plenty of kids like you.

161
13:07.525 --> 13:12.753
They try their best, sure, but nothing ever happens with them.

162
13:16.132 --> 13:20.052
- What? - Kids like that are just pitiful.

163
13:20.052 --> 13:24.441
They're just wasting their time, and will never amount to anything.

164
13:26.111 --> 13:27.450
Mom.

165
13:30.050 --> 13:32.591
Mom, why would you say that?

166
13:32.591 --> 13:33.728
What did I say?

167
13:33.728 --> 13:36.256
What? Mom... Mom, you keep...

168
13:36.256 --> 13:37.517
Quit it.

169
13:37.517 --> 13:39.627
You speak nicely to your mother.

170
13:42.108 --> 13:44.733
No, what I'm saying is, I...

171
13:44.733 --> 13:46.322
I, come on, I'm...

172
13:46.322 --> 13:48.462
Stop stammering and spit it out.

173
13:48.462 --> 13:50.194
You're annoying me.

174
13:50.194 --> 13:51.354
But...

175
13:52.769 --> 13:58.763
I-I haven't even told my friends I'll miss summer school yet!

176
13:59.547 --> 14:01.294
Then do it now!

177
14:01.294 --> 14:03.078
You have your phone, don't you?

178
14:11.737 --> 14:15.263
Hey, guys... I'm going to be absent.

179
14:17.689 --> 14:19.545
What? Why?

180
14:19.545 --> 14:21.755
Did something happen, Ha Yeon?

181
14:22.938 --> 14:25.741
My Dad's going to the suburbs for a caddie job.

182
14:25.741 --> 14:28.619
The whole family's going with him.

183
14:29.225 --> 14:32.392
Oh, no. We can't watch the movie tomorrow, then.

184
14:34.205 --> 14:35.801
Yeah...

185
14:35.801 --> 14:38.572
Hey, then what about my sundress?

186
14:38.572 --> 14:42.408
I didn't even buy anything new because you said you'd let me borrow it!

187
14:42.408 --> 14:46.258
Mi Hee, would you like to borrow my pink blouse instead?

188
14:46.258 --> 14:49.758
Kim Ha Yeon! You should've told me about this sooner!

189
14:55.511 --> 14:56.705
Right, Mom?

190
14:56.705 --> 14:59.503
Can you send me 200,000 won real quick?

191
14:59.503 --> 15:01.433
I want to buy a new game pack.

192
15:01.433 --> 15:03.386
Sure thing.

193
15:03.386 --> 15:05.591
Should I transfer it to your bank now?

194
15:05.591 --> 15:06.638
Yeah.

195
15:10.014 --> 15:11.038
What're you looking at?

196
15:23.464 --> 15:26.883
Screw it, she'd pay for that crap but won't give me 20,000 won for my workbook?

197
15:26.883 --> 15:28.676
"Screw it?"

198
15:28.676 --> 15:30.814
Was that meant for me?

199
15:30.814 --> 15:31.931
Answer me!

200
15:31.931 --> 15:33.475
"Screw it?"

201
15:35.081 --> 15:36.782
I can't take this!

202
15:36.782 --> 15:39.283
This is so messed up!

203
15:39.283 --> 15:40.635
Be quiet!

204
16:00.700 --> 16:03.171
Get your act together, Kim Ha Yeon.

205
16:03.959 --> 16:06.511
It's rude to yell, you rascal!

206
16:07.189 --> 16:08.405
I'm turning in first.

207
16:08.405 --> 16:10.301
Of course, Jung Yeon. You must be exhausted.

208
16:10.301 --> 16:11.721
Get some sleep.

209
16:11.721 --> 16:14.183
- Where's my room? - In there.

210
16:21.148 --> 16:22.260
Hey!

211
16:22.260 --> 16:24.001
Where are you off to?

212
16:24.001 --> 16:27.026
What? He went in. Why shouldn't I?

213
16:27.026 --> 16:28.867
You and he are different.

214
16:28.867 --> 16:30.685
Come unpack with me.

215
16:50.225 --> 16:51.550
Careful!

216
16:51.550 --> 16:52.934
- Why? - Hey.

217
16:52.934 --> 16:54.740
That's your brother's bag.

218
16:54.740 --> 16:57.647
What if there's something important in there?

219
17:05.383 --> 17:06.710
You little...

220
17:06.710 --> 17:08.174
Hey, Kim Ha Yeon!

221
17:08.174 --> 17:09.834
Where are you going?

222
17:24.585 --> 17:27.053
It's not like I want to die.

223
17:46.357 --> 17:47.635
Hey, Kim Ha Yeon.

224
17:47.635 --> 17:49.391
Explain yourself!

225
17:49.391 --> 17:51.305
Did you seriously just say that to me?

226
17:51.305 --> 17:54.532
Look, you promised to lend me that sundress first,

227
17:54.532 --> 17:57.923
and then scrambled off with excuses about your dad.

228
17:57.923 --> 17:59.710
You're the one who should apologize!

229
17:59.710 --> 18:01.771
"Screw it?"

230
18:01.771 --> 18:04.697
Hey. Hey. Hey!

231
18:08.670 --> 18:15.678
[I'm sorry...]

232
18:15.678 --> 18:17.306
I'm sorry...

233
18:31.189 --> 18:33.388
I didn't mean it at you.

234
18:34.641 --> 18:37.658
So why would you say it to me? Pissing me off.

235
18:37.658 --> 18:38.809
I'm sorry.

236
18:38.809 --> 18:42.038
I'll lend you that sundress once summer vacation is over.

237
18:42.038 --> 18:43.663
- Sorry. - I don't need that!

238
18:43.663 --> 18:46.542
I wanted to wear it to my trip with Yun Jae!

239
18:46.542 --> 18:49.378
I need to buy something new because of you! I don't even have money!

240
18:49.378 --> 18:52.174
I have nothing to wear right now.

241
19:11.859 --> 19:12.945
Well...

242
19:13.681 --> 19:16.422
I have 50,000 won. Do you want it?

243
19:18.191 --> 19:19.533
What? Really?

244
19:19.533 --> 19:21.578
Are you sure?

245
19:22.283 --> 19:23.413
It's fine.

246
19:24.464 --> 19:26.696
Thank you so much!

247
19:33.814 --> 19:36.050
Kim Ha Yeon, you better get back home right now!

248
19:36.050 --> 19:41.014
Jung Yeon's missing sleep because of you! And your Dad needs to work tomorrow!

249
19:51.607 --> 19:54.319
What would happen if I did die?

250
19:58.614 --> 20:01.285
Will everyone regret it once I'm gone?

251
20:24.640 --> 20:26.393
Are you out of your mind?

252
20:31.313 --> 20:33.503
I highly doubt it.

253
20:59.633 --> 21:01.053
What's wrong, Yu Gyeom?

254
21:03.012 --> 21:05.181
Why, was something there? What?

255
21:05.181 --> 21:06.350
It's nothing.

256
21:08.309 --> 21:09.685
Are you hungry?

257
21:09.685 --> 21:10.750
No.

258
21:10.750 --> 21:12.730
Want your big sis to make you something at home?

259
21:12.730 --> 21:14.608
We do have burnt rice at home.

260
21:16.515 --> 21:18.723
- No. - Then maybe we should ask Mom to...

261
21:18.723 --> 21:19.940
Wait, no.

262
21:19.940 --> 21:21.841
Grandpa bought some red bean jelly.

263
21:21.841 --> 21:23.617
- Would you like to-- - Sis.

264
21:24.957 --> 21:26.590
It's fine, really.

265
23:23.779 --> 23:30.672
The one who will be competing in the National Swimming Championship...

266
23:34.705 --> 23:35.960
is Im Jeong Uk.

267
23:35.960 --> 23:37.234
Give him a round of applause!

268
23:45.013 --> 23:48.308
You, Jeong Uk, will stay after class for practice starting today.

269
23:48.308 --> 23:49.970
- Okay? - Yes, sir.

270
23:49.970 --> 23:51.014
Disperse!

271
23:51.014 --> 23:54.080
- Great work! - Thank you, sir!

272
23:54.080 --> 23:55.582
- Good job. - Thanks.

273
23:55.582 --> 23:57.765
- Thank you. - I knew it.

274
24:01.312 --> 24:04.752
[Congratulations, pro golfer Cho Ji Hyeon, winner of the Lifestar Championship]

275
24:05.819 --> 24:07.722
- Careful, sir. - I must be getting fat.

276
24:07.722 --> 24:11.637
- Nice seeing you here. - Good to see you.

277
24:27.966 --> 24:29.702
Look at the camera.

278
24:29.702 --> 24:32.193
One, two, three!

279
24:35.651 --> 24:37.976
Look, Father. Now that's a good photo!

280
24:37.976 --> 24:40.314
It looks good.

281
24:42.347 --> 24:46.259
By the way, Father, where's Yu Gyeom?

282
24:46.259 --> 24:47.969
Hey, Sam Hee!

283
24:47.969 --> 24:49.071
Yes, Grandpa?

284
24:49.071 --> 24:50.723
Go get Yu Gyeom, will you?

285
24:50.723 --> 24:52.544
Auntie wants to see him.

286
24:52.544 --> 24:54.099
Yes, Grandpa!

287
25:15.993 --> 25:17.023
Mom!

288
25:17.023 --> 25:18.058
What is it?

289
25:18.058 --> 25:19.841
Grandpa's looking for Yu Gyeom.

290
25:19.841 --> 25:21.356
Go look for him in his room, then.

291
25:21.356 --> 25:23.006
He's not there. I just checked.

292
25:23.006 --> 25:27.356
- Not there? - But Grandpa wants to see him right now.

293
25:27.356 --> 25:29.405
What about the beach, then? Did you check there?

294
25:29.405 --> 25:31.765
- No. - Well, then go and check now.

295
25:31.765 --> 25:34.014
Quickly, before he gets mad.

296
25:34.014 --> 25:35.865
Hey, Cho Yu Gyeom!

297
25:37.485 --> 25:38.950
Cho Yu Gyeom!

298
25:44.605 --> 25:45.918
Hey, Cho Yu Gyeom.

299
25:49.156 --> 25:50.481
What're you up to?

300
25:52.305 --> 25:54.499
The town is holding a feast for your aunt.

301
25:55.694 --> 25:57.308
Come on, get up.

302
26:01.123 --> 26:02.957
I said, get up.

303
26:07.407 --> 26:09.248
Your hand won't fall off, you know.

304
26:11.374 --> 26:14.135
I saw your aunt wearing a pig's head.

305
26:14.856 --> 26:16.896
- Sung Sae Ryeong. - Yeah? What?

306
26:18.690 --> 26:22.164
That's my paternal aunt, not my maternal.

307
26:22.164 --> 26:26.906
By the way, Yu Gyeom, can't you just hold my hand for once?

308
26:26.906 --> 26:31.305
By the way, Sae Ryeong, can't we just walk like this for once?

309
26:50.032 --> 26:52.025
Look, Yu Gyeom's here!

310
26:52.025 --> 26:53.529
- Hello. - You're here, Yu Gyeom!

311
26:53.529 --> 26:55.155
- There you are, Yu Gyeom. - Good, that's good.

312
26:55.155 --> 26:57.324
- What a handsome boy you are! - How you've grown!

313
26:57.324 --> 27:00.118
- Hey, Yu Gyeom! - There you are!

314
27:00.118 --> 27:03.672
- So handsome! - You've grown taller!

315
27:03.672 --> 27:05.404
You're so handsome!

316
27:07.417 --> 27:09.894
Everyone, sit down and eat.

317
27:09.894 --> 27:13.053
And Yu Gyeom, come inside.

318
27:19.110 --> 27:21.211
Excuse me, Father.

319
27:21.211 --> 27:22.924
Enter.

320
27:28.230 --> 27:29.847
Put it here.

321
27:31.730 --> 27:32.763
Where's Sam Hee?

322
27:32.763 --> 27:36.305
She's out running an errand right now.

323
27:36.305 --> 27:39.614
Give her a ride. It's hot out.

324
27:44.860 --> 27:47.074
Sit up straight.

325
27:50.335 --> 27:54.914
Your tutor came by this morning.

326
27:54.914 --> 27:57.925
I heard you're good at that thing you do.

327
27:58.844 --> 27:59.883
Swimming, sir.

328
27:59.883 --> 28:00.980
Yes, that.

329
28:00.980 --> 28:06.815
He asked me to let you enter the competition.

330
28:07.546 --> 28:09.048
Are you going to?

331
28:11.252 --> 28:12.942
No, sir. No.

332
28:14.022 --> 28:16.156
Are you sure you don't want to?

333
28:16.156 --> 28:18.230
Yes, I'm sure.

334
28:18.230 --> 28:19.369
Good.

335
28:19.369 --> 28:22.097
You just can't, Yu Gyeom.

336
28:23.324 --> 28:26.910
As for why, you must know, right?

337
28:26.910 --> 28:29.450
Because I'm a part of this family.

338
28:29.450 --> 28:30.752
Correct.

339
28:30.752 --> 28:34.433
You have to stay dedicated to this house.

340
28:34.433 --> 28:36.090
Right?

341
28:36.090 --> 28:38.116
Right, although my aunt doesn't need to.

342
28:38.116 --> 28:40.798
She wasn't born into this family!

343
28:40.798 --> 28:42.584
And I was. I know.

344
28:44.910 --> 28:46.850
That's enough.

345
28:46.850 --> 28:48.289
You may leave.

346
29:00.924 --> 29:02.296
Yu Gyeom!

347
29:03.443 --> 29:05.730
Yu Gyeom, how have you been?

348
29:05.730 --> 29:08.571
Have you been well? Yeah?

349
29:08.571 --> 29:11.173
Be polite, Yu Gyeom. Answer me.

350
29:11.173 --> 29:12.950
Yes, I've been...

351
29:14.850 --> 29:15.943
well.

352
29:15.943 --> 29:17.924
My dearest boy!

353
29:17.924 --> 29:20.864
Come on, keep your eyes on me.

354
29:20.864 --> 29:23.530
My goodness, how long has it been?

355
29:23.530 --> 29:26.473
Your auntie missed you so much!

356
29:26.473 --> 29:28.981
We met last month for the ancestral memorial rite.

357
29:28.981 --> 29:30.842
So it's been about three weeks.

358
29:30.842 --> 29:31.873
Truly?

359
29:31.873 --> 29:33.772
Three weeks?

360
29:33.772 --> 29:39.674
Yu Gyeom, your auntie starts missing you so badly after only a week apart!

361
29:39.674 --> 29:42.545
My dear boy.

362
29:42.545 --> 29:44.141
Yu Gyeom, you know, right?

363
29:44.141 --> 29:45.577
You're my boy.

364
29:45.577 --> 29:47.718
My son, that I bore through my heart.

365
29:47.718 --> 29:49.602
You know that, right?

366
29:55.700 --> 29:57.339
You!

367
29:57.339 --> 29:59.165
You there!

368
29:59.165 --> 30:01.110
Why aren't you bowing to me?

369
30:02.524 --> 30:04.527
Yes, ma'am.

370
30:04.527 --> 30:06.353
Greetings.

371
30:08.676 --> 30:09.749
Oh, dear!

372
30:10.635 --> 30:12.891
I never knew you could laugh, my boy!

373
30:15.092 --> 30:17.099
Goodness me, he just laughed!

374
30:19.192 --> 30:20.908
What a pretty laugh you have!

375
30:34.729 --> 30:37.711
Mi Hee and Yun Ah's girls' day out!

376
30:37.711 --> 30:40.680
So bummed out that Ha Yeon wasn't there.

377
30:40.680 --> 30:42.997
How's it going in that backwater town, Ha Yeon?

378
30:42.997 --> 30:44.456
Having fun?

379
30:46.417 --> 30:49.100
No, it's really boring.

380
30:52.641 --> 30:54.917
But honestly, it's no different from being with you guys.

381
30:58.393 --> 31:00.162
Hey, Kim Ha Yeon!

382
31:06.855 --> 31:09.629
Darling, what time is the tee off tomorrow?

383
31:10.343 --> 31:11.648
6 o'clock.

384
31:11.648 --> 31:13.251
What do you want?

385
31:13.251 --> 31:15.956
See that rice cake over there? Portion it out.

386
31:15.956 --> 31:18.167
Pack them up nicely.

387
31:18.167 --> 31:21.077
Make sure you stack them, two in a bag.

388
31:22.251 --> 31:25.682
Can't you make him do stuff like this?

389
31:25.682 --> 31:26.747
What?

390
31:27.755 --> 31:30.539
I need to study, too.

391
31:30.539 --> 31:33.930
I need to make up for the classes I'm missing, or my grades will suffer.

392
31:33.930 --> 31:37.069
You can study after you pack the rice cake.

393
31:38.723 --> 31:40.896
This is so frustrating.

394
31:44.783 --> 31:46.118
What now?

395
32:16.101 --> 32:18.680
It's already past midnight.

396
32:18.680 --> 32:21.360
When will I get to sleep if I have to study after all this?

397
32:21.360 --> 32:24.216
Just tell Jung Yeon to do it. He's playing games right now!

398
32:24.216 --> 32:28.531
His hands are too big for delicate chores like that.

399
32:29.205 --> 32:30.625
What?

400
32:30.625 --> 32:32.735
Stop slacking off, come on!

401
32:34.718 --> 32:38.090
I wonder how he plays mobile games with such huge hands.

402
32:39.549 --> 32:41.243
Don't you talk back to me like that!

403
32:41.243 --> 32:42.736
I should punish you!

404
32:42.736 --> 32:45.239
Why would you hit me?

405
32:47.211 --> 32:50.174
I don't need such a crappy mom.

406
32:50.174 --> 32:52.921
I don't need these crappy friends.

407
32:52.921 --> 32:54.908
I'd rather be an orphan and an outcast.

408
32:54.908 --> 32:58.098
I'll make it out of here. I'll escape,

409
32:58.790 --> 33:01.424
and I will change my fate.

410
33:01.424 --> 33:03.477
Whatever it takes...

411
33:24.252 --> 33:25.399
But...

412
33:26.713 --> 33:29.665
How does one go about changing their fate?

413
33:42.062 --> 33:44.536
- Mom. - Yes?

414
33:44.536 --> 33:48.993
Why do we call her "aunt?"

415
33:51.711 --> 33:54.057
She's not really my aunt, so what's up with that?

416
33:54.057 --> 33:56.576
She's just Father's first love.

417
33:56.576 --> 33:57.800
Yu Gyeom.

418
33:57.800 --> 33:59.754
And isn't she just horrible?

419
33:59.754 --> 34:03.060
She acts like she runs the place, even though she's not really in power.

420
34:03.060 --> 34:04.297
She's so rude to you, too.

421
34:04.297 --> 34:07.202
Calling you "hey" and "you there."

422
34:09.214 --> 34:13.118
Actually, I do think she's horrible, too.

423
34:13.118 --> 34:15.254
I hate her guts.

424
34:17.150 --> 34:20.023
Why don't you leave the family?

425
34:21.080 --> 34:22.585
What a shame.

426
34:23.468 --> 34:26.547
I already left my family for this one.

427
34:26.547 --> 34:29.374
I heard that gray divorces are all the rage these days.

428
34:31.024 --> 34:33.346
You're funny.

429
34:37.697 --> 34:39.658
- And, Mom? - Yeah?

430
34:40.787 --> 34:47.588
In celebration of your divorce, can I get a phone?

431
34:49.780 --> 34:51.927
- What? - Come on.

432
34:51.927 --> 34:54.490
I'm 18 years old without a phone in this day and age.

433
34:54.490 --> 34:58.612
It's wild that I have to write on paper and use a carrier pigeon to contact people.

434
35:01.226 --> 35:02.851
Silly boy.

435
35:03.618 --> 35:06.849
Is this what you were getting at all this time?

436
35:06.849 --> 35:08.176
Was it so obvious?

437
35:08.176 --> 35:10.527
You've become so sly.

438
35:10.527 --> 35:11.858
Ask your Grandpa.

439
35:11.858 --> 35:13.194
I do have a secret of birth.

440
35:13.194 --> 35:15.062
No way.

441
35:19.058 --> 35:20.806
And a special talent.

442
36:20.261 --> 36:22.330
Cho Yu Gyeom!

443
36:23.417 --> 36:26.997
Cho Yu Gyeom!

444
36:26.997 --> 36:28.301
Get out here right now!

445
36:28.301 --> 36:30.980
Come back out, young master!

446
36:30.980 --> 36:32.834
What's gotten into you?

447
36:32.834 --> 36:36.887
I have a beautiful girlfriend, and fitting friends, but...

448
36:36.887 --> 36:40.187
What are you doing in there?

449
36:42.409 --> 36:44.342
It's all so boring.

450
36:51.641 --> 36:52.794
No.

451
36:52.794 --> 36:55.935
I already told you this is a hard no.

452
36:55.935 --> 36:57.728
Whatever, don't do it, then.

453
36:57.728 --> 36:59.146
Are you leaving?

454
36:59.859 --> 37:00.893
Yeah.

455
37:00.893 --> 37:02.554
Don't be like that.

456
37:02.554 --> 37:04.926
Stay here with me for a while.

457
37:04.926 --> 37:06.184
What's there to do?

458
37:06.184 --> 37:08.667
Talk. About you and me.

459
37:08.667 --> 37:09.860
What do you say?

460
37:10.620 --> 37:13.518
We know everything about each other's lives. What's there to talk about?

461
37:14.507 --> 37:15.900
Cho Yu Gyeom.

462
37:18.499 --> 37:20.333
Why? What?

463
37:21.755 --> 37:25.886
Then what are you dating me for?

464
37:57.692 --> 37:59.601
Mom! Everyone's here!

465
37:59.601 --> 38:01.450
Should I bring this out now?

466
38:01.450 --> 38:02.847
Where's Yu Gyeom?

467
38:03.613 --> 38:06.844
Well, he's not there.

468
38:06.844 --> 38:08.150
What?

469
38:17.045 --> 38:18.884
Mom.

470
38:37.857 --> 38:39.882
You can have the rice cake on the table.

471
38:39.882 --> 38:42.785
I'm going into town to get some clothes for your brother.

472
38:42.785 --> 38:46.221
Also, don't forget to make him breakfast when he wakes up!

473
39:06.803 --> 39:08.518
Where's Yu Gyeom?

474
39:09.258 --> 39:10.942
He's... well...

475
39:10.942 --> 39:12.920
He's just...

476
39:12.920 --> 39:15.508
- Father. - You should eat, Father.

477
39:16.408 --> 39:18.439
Why isn't Yu Gyeom here?

478
39:18.439 --> 39:21.949
I sent him out to run an errand, that's all.

479
39:21.949 --> 39:23.585
He'll be here soon.

480
39:23.585 --> 39:25.225
Go ahead and eat, Father.

481
39:27.765 --> 39:29.150
What's wrong?

482
39:31.786 --> 39:34.035
Alright. Let's eat.

483
39:38.960 --> 39:41.209
Your brother this, your brother that, all day and night!

484
39:41.209 --> 39:44.170
I'd rather she was my stepmom. That way I'd go look for my real one.

485
39:44.170 --> 39:46.075
I can't believe this is the mom I'm stuck with!

486
39:46.075 --> 39:48.952
This is just the worst!

487
41:03.336 --> 41:04.384
By the way, Ha Yeon.

488
41:04.384 --> 41:07.087
50,000 won isn't enough to buy anything at all!

489
41:07.087 --> 41:09.002
Have you got any more?

490
41:09.002 --> 41:12.878
I spent all my money buying new sneakers for Yun Jae.

491
41:12.878 --> 41:16.331
I'm not asking you to give me money. I just want to borrow it!

492
41:17.394 --> 41:20.350
Sure, you broke tramp.

493
41:25.566 --> 41:27.989
Change my fate? What a joke.

494
41:34.867 --> 41:35.997
Sure.

495
41:45.086 --> 41:46.271
What's that?

496
41:48.208 --> 41:49.453
Is that a person?

497
41:54.698 --> 41:56.006
Hey, there!

498
41:57.721 --> 41:58.997
Someone...

499
42:23.958 --> 42:25.352
Wait!

500
42:27.881 --> 42:29.073
Hey.

501
42:30.047 --> 42:31.519
Hey, you!

502
42:36.299 --> 42:38.219
Are you okay?

503
42:39.478 --> 42:41.176
Are you alive?

504
42:45.605 --> 42:47.237
Oh, you're alive!

505
42:47.237 --> 42:49.145
Thank goodness!

506
43:00.536 --> 43:03.542
I thought you were drowning, and...

507
43:03.542 --> 43:04.813
Listen.

508
43:06.124 --> 43:09.955
If you ever see someone drowning, you don't just jump in.

509
43:10.689 --> 43:12.594
You call emergency services.

510
43:17.488 --> 43:20.285
By the way, why are you talking to me so informally?

511
43:22.558 --> 43:24.599
Mister?

512
43:28.356 --> 43:30.347
You don't know me.

513
43:34.654 --> 43:35.946
Do you?

514
43:37.317 --> 43:38.724
Are you a senior?

515
43:39.842 --> 43:40.899
No.

516
43:41.826 --> 43:43.261
So I'm not in the wrong.

517
44:17.989 --> 44:19.532
Do you know Upo Country Club?

518
44:19.532 --> 44:21.993
It's a golf course.

519
44:21.993 --> 44:23.718
Is that where you came from?

520
44:23.718 --> 44:24.936
Yeah.

521
44:24.936 --> 44:27.127
I don't know my way back.

522
44:27.993 --> 44:32.406
You came all the way here from there, but don't know how to get there from here?

523
44:34.460 --> 44:37.015
I used the map on my phone.

524
44:38.919 --> 44:40.895
But I soaked it in seawater.

525
44:43.681 --> 44:45.660
Do you know how to get there?

526
44:46.707 --> 44:50.920
Just keep walking that way and cross at the 16-lane road.

527
44:52.888 --> 44:54.030
Thanks.

528
45:02.658 --> 45:04.105
I'm freezing.

529
45:13.252 --> 45:14.256
Hey.

530
45:22.345 --> 45:23.481
Here.

531
45:27.725 --> 45:29.497
Put it on, and follow me.

532
45:50.289 --> 45:51.958
We're here.

533
45:53.042 --> 45:54.111
Thanks.

534
45:56.295 --> 45:57.883
No need. You can take it with you.

535
45:58.631 --> 46:00.466
But it's yours.

536
46:00.466 --> 46:01.970
It's fine.

537
46:35.209 --> 46:36.764
Hey.

538
46:36.764 --> 46:38.023
Yeah?

539
46:38.023 --> 46:40.326
Do you want to give it back to me?

540
46:41.153 --> 46:42.181
What?

541
46:42.181 --> 46:43.968
My shirt.

542
46:43.968 --> 46:45.625
Do you want to return it?

543
46:46.338 --> 46:48.863
Well, yeah, it's yours.

544
46:54.895 --> 46:56.925
How long are you staying here?

545
46:59.817 --> 47:02.406
Until the end of summer vacation, probably.

546
47:03.362 --> 47:05.031
That's...

547
47:05.031 --> 47:06.705
three weeks from now, right?

548
47:06.705 --> 47:08.117
Yeah.

549
47:08.117 --> 47:10.270
I'll be around here every evening.

550
47:11.412 --> 47:12.637
What?

551
47:12.637 --> 47:16.646
Nothing, just letting you know I'll be around after 9 o'clock.

552
47:16.646 --> 47:18.104
Someplace nearby.

553
47:18.104 --> 47:22.909
Like the beach, or the alleyways behind the beach.

554
47:22.909 --> 47:24.350
Just around.

555
47:25.104 --> 47:27.472
- So what do you mean by-- - What I'm saying is,

556
47:27.472 --> 47:31.195
if we cross paths again on any evening, you can give it back then.

557
47:33.270 --> 47:37.937
But this is a huge neighborhood. The chances are pretty slim.

558
47:37.937 --> 47:39.577
We'll see each other when we do.

559
47:44.111 --> 47:45.362
Hey!

560
47:57.041 --> 47:59.120
I'll be around here every evening.

561
48:01.080 --> 48:05.016
Nothing, just letting you know I'll be around after 9 o'clock.

562
48:19.656 --> 48:21.996
[Biographies of Royal Consorts]

563
48:22.862 --> 48:25.622
[Taejo Wang Geon] [The Heart Sutra]

564
48:51.595 --> 48:53.206
Are you okay?

565
48:55.128 --> 48:56.577
You came here from Seoul?

566
48:57.280 --> 48:58.517
Why?

567
49:00.285 --> 49:02.018
Because it's summer vacation.

568
49:14.910 --> 49:17.985
Darling, what time is the tee off tomorrow?

569
49:19.806 --> 49:21.853
5:30 in the morning.

570
49:22.930 --> 49:25.647
- Well, then I'll... - Mom.

571
49:25.647 --> 49:27.358
What's the address for this place?

572
49:27.358 --> 49:29.250
I need to receive a package.

573
49:30.320 --> 49:31.971
The address...

574
49:32.911 --> 49:34.927
Gyeongsangbuk-do?

575
49:34.927 --> 49:36.852
Ha Yeon!

576
49:36.852 --> 49:39.175
Search up the address, will you?

577
49:40.513 --> 49:42.216
Ha Yeon!

578
49:53.132 --> 49:55.492
[How does one go about changing their fate?]

579
50:06.128 --> 50:07.337
Kim Ha Yeon!

580
50:09.476 --> 50:12.727
What are you doing? I told you to look up the address!

581
50:12.727 --> 50:14.311
Where are you off to?

582
50:14.311 --> 50:16.403
Do you even know what time it is?

583
50:16.403 --> 50:18.320
9 o'clock!

584
50:21.944 --> 50:24.095
That little rascal!

585
50:30.778 --> 50:32.358
Yu Gyeom, Grandpa wants...

586
50:32.358 --> 50:33.410
No.

587
50:33.410 --> 50:35.128
What do you mean, "no"?

588
50:35.128 --> 50:36.742
I said, Grandpa wants...

589
50:36.742 --> 50:37.817
Quiet.

590
50:37.817 --> 50:39.787
Where are you going? Yu Gyeom!

591
50:39.787 --> 50:41.374
Cho Yu Gyeom!

592
50:49.463 --> 50:51.369
I like movies.

593
51:00.849 --> 51:02.625
I believe in fate.

594
51:05.479 --> 51:09.517
I await a prince on a white horse or my rich birth parents to come find me.

595
51:09.517 --> 51:14.091
I believe that one day, a miracle may happen to me.

596
51:14.945 --> 51:16.414
I believe.

597
51:18.089 --> 51:20.635
I believe in fate, and this summer.

598
51:20.635 --> 51:23.451
In everything that's going to happen this summer.

599
51:24.581 --> 51:28.209
In all the magical moments that are to come this summer.

600
51:29.378 --> 51:31.133
- I wish for them. - I wish for them.

601
51:52.067 --> 51:54.487
Letting you know I'll be around after 9 o'clock.

602
51:54.487 --> 51:55.934
Someplace nearby.

603
51:55.934 --> 52:00.710
Like the beach, or the alleyways behind the beach.

604
52:00.710 --> 52:02.261
Just around.

605
52:15.758 --> 52:17.288
What're you gawking at?

606
52:20.971 --> 52:22.662
Hey, are you a student?

607
52:22.662 --> 52:23.932
Where are you going?

608
52:23.932 --> 52:28.349
- You're cute. - Come over here, let's play. Want a drink?

609
52:28.349 --> 52:29.688
Hey, I asked where you're going!

610
52:29.688 --> 52:31.412
- It's late. - Come here.

611
52:31.412 --> 52:32.652
- Hey, cutie! - Go home!

612
52:32.652 --> 52:34.755
- Are you deaf? - Pretty girl!

613
52:34.755 --> 52:36.605
It's dangerous out here. I'll take you home.

614
52:36.605 --> 52:39.050
- Get over here, let's have fun. - Look here, I love you!

615
52:39.050 --> 52:41.161
- I'll take you home! - Cut it out!

616
52:41.161 --> 52:42.829
- Come on! - You're scaring her.

617
52:42.829 --> 52:44.602
Come home with me.

618
52:44.602 --> 52:47.385
- Stop saying that, bro. - I'm just messing with her.

619
53:15.573 --> 53:17.275
What about my shirt?

620
53:28.122 --> 53:29.244
It's this way!

621
53:29.244 --> 53:30.413
No, not there.

622
53:30.413 --> 53:31.707
This way!

623
53:31.707 --> 53:33.783
What the hell, she's not here!

624
53:33.783 --> 53:35.989
No, I said it's this way.

625
53:35.989 --> 53:37.839
I saw her go this way.

626
53:43.303 --> 53:44.460
She's not here.

627
53:44.460 --> 53:47.103
Look, I have 20/20 vision.

628
53:47.103 --> 53:48.823
- That adds up to 40. - What do we do?

629
53:48.823 --> 53:53.631
I saw the girl go this way, and a boy followed her inside.

630
53:56.150 --> 53:57.985
I swear I saw it!

631
53:57.985 --> 54:00.345
Why are you guys ganging up on me?

632
54:00.345 --> 54:02.772
Then they must be hiding.

633
54:13.417 --> 54:15.239
Did you guys know about that door?

634
54:15.239 --> 54:18.017
What? A door? Where?

635
54:19.715 --> 54:21.136
Let's check it out.

636
54:26.430 --> 54:27.838
See? I told you!

637
54:27.838 --> 54:30.058
They definitely went this way!

638
54:30.058 --> 54:32.236
Look again!

639
54:32.236 --> 54:33.601
There's nobody here.

640
54:33.601 --> 54:34.922
You!

641
54:34.922 --> 54:37.444
Are you sure you saw them go this way?

642
54:37.444 --> 54:39.976
I did, I'm sure!

643
54:39.976 --> 54:41.458
I...

644
54:41.458 --> 54:43.907
- I swear I saw them. - He's lying.

645
54:43.907 --> 54:45.301
Just a load of crap.

646
54:45.301 --> 54:46.924
Are there any other doors here?

647
54:46.924 --> 54:48.859
Fat chance.

648
54:49.759 --> 54:51.776
I swear I saw them!

649
55:00.088 --> 55:02.857
Whatever, man. Let's get back to drinking.

650
55:04.230 --> 55:05.596
Aren't you coming?

651
55:05.596 --> 55:07.186
But I swear...

652
56:06.905 --> 56:08.874
I think they're gone now.

653
56:20.460 --> 56:22.511
I believe in fate.

654
56:24.208 --> 56:25.369
Sorry.

655
56:26.971 --> 56:28.150
What for?

656
56:32.180 --> 56:34.575
I forgot to bring your shirt.

657
56:37.811 --> 56:39.060
I'm sorry.

658
56:40.658 --> 56:42.279
I don't care.

659
56:47.466 --> 56:49.170
I don't care anymore.

660
56:56.121 --> 57:00.299
I... But I've never done this before.

661
57:01.489 --> 57:03.010
Do you want to stop?

662
57:12.888 --> 57:15.783
In everything that's going to happen this summer.

663
57:32.269 --> 57:35.582
In all the magical moments that are to come this summer.

664
57:40.666 --> 57:42.216
I wish for them.

665
57:43.210 --> 57:44.765
I wish for them.
